:Course_b-tech-in-civil-engineering a :Course ;
    :belongs_to :Department_department-of-civil-engineering ;
    :description "Department of Civil Engineering Summary The Department of Civil Engineering is part of the Institute since the inception of MESITAM in 2009.The department offers B.Tech in Civil Engineering, affiliated to APJ Abdul Kalam Technological University with an approved intake of 60 students. The department has highly qualified faculty members specialized in various Civil Engineering disciplines, educated from reputed institutions across India. The department has excellent Computational and Laboratory facilities for carrying out experimental works in frontier areas of Civil Engineering and also facilitates to execute students innovative project works. Besides quality teaching and instruction at Undergraduate level, the department offers Professional Consultancy works & Technical Assistance to Various Government & Non Governmental organizations. Our department is proud of the Alumni’s, who are we" ;
    :hasName "B.Tech in Civil Engineering" ;
    :sourceUrl "https://www.mesitam.ac.in/civil-engineering.php" .

:Course_b-tech-in-computer-science-engineering a :Course ;
    :belongs_to :Department_department-of-computer-science-engineering ;
    :description "Department of Computer Science & Engineering Computer Science & Engineering Summary Department of Computer Science and Engineering offers 4-year B.Tech. Degree programs in Computer Science and Engineering with a sanctioned intake of 90 and Computer Science and Engineering (Artificial Intelligence)* with a sanctioned intake of 30. The department has good number of faculty pursuing PhD and substantial experience in teaching and industry. Experienced and well qualified resource persons encourage the students to accomplish a high level knowledge and skills on recent trends in computing technologies and innovations. Read More Department has close relationship with reputed institutions and establishments to support students in their academics and final projects as internship. The prominent features of the department cover continuous evaluation of student performance through well planned assess" ;
    :hasName "B.Tech in Computer Science & Engineering" ;
    :sourceUrl "https://www.mesitam.ac.in/computer-science-and-engineering.php" .

:Course_b-tech-in-computer-science-engineering-artificial-intelligence a :Course ;
    :belongs_to :Department_department-of-computer-science-engineering-artificial-intelligence ;
    :description "Department of Computer Science & Engineering (Artificial Intelligence) Computer Science & Engineering (Artificial Intelligence) Summary Objectives Head of Department Prof. Basima Yoosaf Prof.Basima Yoosaf is the Head of the Department of Computer Science and Engineering (AI) at MES Institute of Technology and Management, where she has been serving since 2011. She holds a B.Tech and M.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering and has over 14 years of teaching experience in undergraduate engineering education. Her academic journey reflects a dynamic progression of interests beginning with Computer Networks, Data Communication, advancing into Cloud Computing, Python, Data Analytics and currently specializing in Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning and Data Science. With a strong focus on student-centered education, Prof. Basima emphasizes practical learning, problem-solving, and real-wo" ;
    :hasName "B.Tech in Computer Science & Engineering (Artificial Intelligence)" ;
    :sourceUrl "https://www.mesitam.ac.in/computer-science-and-engineering-AI.php" .

:Course_b-tech-in-electrical-electronics-engineering a :Course ;
    :belongs_to :Department_department-of-electrical-electronics-engineering ;
    :description "Department of Electrical & Electronics Engineering Electrical & Electronics Engineering Summary There is an exponential expansion in the electrical engineering field in the recent years. Electric vehicles, robotics, artificial intelligence, advancements in material science, renewable energy production, distributed generation and smart grids and so on. All modern equipmens (whether it is industrial or residential) are in one way or other depending on electrical power. Design, application and maintenance of all electrical apparatus demands variety of engineers with sound knowledge in Electrical Engineering. Read More The Department of Electrical & Electronics Engineering, established in the year 2009, is providing quality professional education to aspiring engineers. The department had an annual intake of 60 from 2009 to 2017 admissions, and 30 from 2018 admissions. We are offering Under G" ;
    :hasName "B.Tech in Electrical & Electronics Engineering" ;
    :sourceUrl "https://www.mesitam.ac.in/electrical-and-electronics-engineering.php" .

:Course_b-tech-in-electronics-communication-engineering a :Course ;
    :belongs_to :Department_department-of-electronics-communication-engineering ;
    :description "Department of Electronics & Communication Engineering Electronics & Communication Engineering Summary The Department of Electronics and Communication Engineering in MESITAM started in the year 2009 with student intake of 60. Fully fledged laboratories have been set up in the department in due course, as needed, right from 2009. Efficient and experienced faculty was appointed from the beginning of the course. Faculty development programs are frequently arranged within the department by classes handled by faculty within the department itself. Read More Students are having their association within the college and within the department to conduct different academic and cultural activities. Internship programs are arranged for students with experts from various enterprises. Read Less Objectives To impart a strong foundation on the basics of Electronics and Communication Engineering. To cultiv" ;
    :hasName "B.Tech in Electronics & Communication Engineering" ;
    :sourceUrl "https://www.mesitam.ac.in/electronics-and-communication-engineering.php" .

:Course_b-tech-in-mechanical-engineering a :Course ;
    :belongs_to :Department_department-of-mechanical-engineering ;
    :description "Department of Mechanical Engineering Summary Mechanical Engineering Department has started in the year 2011 with an intake of 60 students in undergraduate programme. Lateral entry students are admitted in the third semester as per AICTE norms in the UG course. Add to the charm, the department is enriched with full-fledged laboratories,with latest technology and syllabus requirements which provide the students, a hands-on experience in Mechanical Engineering.In addition to this regular course, department endeavours to conduct various short-term courses / workshops and training programmes. The department offers remedial classes for the weaker students. The department motivate and provide coaching for students, who are preparing for competitive examinations like GATE and IES.The department faculty rooms, various departments and the laboratories are connected by the institute LAN and interne" ;
    :hasName "B.Tech in Mechanical Engineering" ;
    :sourceUrl "https://www.mesitam.ac.in/mechanical-engineering.php" .

:Course_mba-program a :Course ;
    :belongs_to :Department_master-of-business-administration-mba ;
    :description "Master of Business Administration (MBA) Master of Business Administration Summary The Department of Management Studies at MES Institute of Technology and Management proudly launches its first MBA batch, marking a new chapter of academic excellence and leadership development. The program is designed to nurture future business leaders who can thrive in a dynamic, global environment. With a strong emphasis on academic rigor, innovation, and industry relevance, the MBA program aims to bridge the gap between theory and practice. Students will be guided by an expert faculty team, supported by state-of-the-art resources, and exposed to real-world business challenges that sharpen their decision-making and leadership skills. Objectives The primary objective of the MBA program is to develop competent, ethical, and socially responsible leaders who can adapt to the rapidly changing business landscap" ;
    :hasName "Master of Business Administration (MBA)" ;
    :sourceUrl "https://www.mesitam.ac.in/mba.php" .

