:Facility_central-library-and-information-centre a :Facility ;
    :description "Welcome to MESITAM Engineering THE RIGHT WAY Computing Facilities The Institute is having state of the art computer labs and resource center. Recognizing the challenges that the industry has put forth in terms of information technology, the institution's computer labs hosts a range of latest software and hardware. Whole computers are networked. Leased line connectivity for a bandwidth of 100 Mbps is being catered across the network. All latest hardware/software support is given in synchronization with the curriculum prescribed by the university. Central Library and Information Centre A fully automated modern Library & Information Centre (LIC) is on its way to becoming an outstanding learning resource centre catering to the ever growing information and intellectual requirements of the students, faculty, and researchers. A state of the art Digital Library is set in the Library premises for catering e-resources to the students and teachers. Digital Library A state of the art Digital library has been established in the Central Library premises with effective e-Iearning materials, e-databases, e-journals, e-books etc. It can be accessed from anywhere in the campus. The library is an act" ;
    :hasName "Central Library and Information Centre" ;
    :sourceUrl "https://www.mesitam.ac.in/facilities.php" .

