    :sourceUrl "https://www.mesitam.ac.in/computer-science-and-engineering-AI.php" .

:Department_master-of-business-administration-mba a :Department ;
    :description "Master of Business Administration (MBA) Master of Business Administration Summary The Department of Management Studies at MES Institute of Technology and Management proudly launches its first MBA batch, marking a new chapter of academic excellence and leadership development. The program is designed to nurture future business leaders who can thrive in a dynamic, global environment. With a strong emphasis on academic rigor, innovation, and industry relevance, the MBA program aims to bridge the gap between theory and practice. Students will be guided by an expert faculty team, supported by state-of-the-art resources, and exposed to real-world business challenges that sharpen their decision-making and leadership skills. Objectives The primary objective of the MBA program is to develop competent, ethical, and socially responsible leaders who can adapt to the rapidly changing business landscap" ;
    :hasName "Master of Business Administration (MBA)" ;
    :has_faculty :Faculty_master-of-business-administration-mba-dr-bharathi-veena-b,
