:Department_department-of-mathematics-science a :Department ;
    :description "Department of Mathematics & Science Summary The Department was established in 2009. The department comprises Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and English. The department has highly qualified, dedicated and sincere Faculty members. The departments of Physics, Chemistry and English have well equipped sophisticated labs. Read More Mathematics Department Mathematics Department has a senior and experienced faculty member together with young and dynamic faculty members. The department has 6 teaching faculties with MPhil degree and teaching experience ranging from 5years to 37 years. The department provides a strong foundation of Mathematical basics which are building blocks of all subjects in engineering field. A sound knowledge of Mathematics is highly essential for the development and understanding of each and every technological process. Chemistry Department The department has an experienced" ;
